OL,3,GNEWSAUrgent safety works at derelict
OL,4,Apottery factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FUrgent safety works have been ordered
OL,7,Fat a fire-hit former pottery factory
OL,8,Fafter inspections found parts of the
OL,9,Fbuilding posed a safety risk.
OL,11,FThe former Wade Ceramics site, on
OL,12,FWestport Road in Burslem,
OL,13,FStoke-on-Trent, was damaged when the
OL,14,Ffire, believed to be arson, broke out
OL,15,Fin April 2025.
OL,17,FEmergency works were carried out
OL,18,Ffollowing the blaze to make the Grade
OL,19,FII listed building safer and reduce the
OL,20,Frisk of further collapse.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
