OL,3,GNEWSAUrgent safety works at derelict
OL,4,Apottery factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut recent inspections had since
OL,7,Fidentified more areas of concern,
OL,8,FStoke-on-Trent City Council confirmed,
OL,9,Fwith the owner of the site instructed
OL,10,Fto remove impacted sections of the
OL,11,Fbuilding to reduce the risk to the
OL,12,Fpublic.
